  "_note": "Public placeholder cell: a Rosie 1430 V1 arm on six A6-EC drives, binding robot_description/robots/rosie_1430_v1 and rt-core/config/machines/example-arm-1430.json, for tests and as the pattern for a Rosie 1430 cell. Hosts are RFC 5737 documentation addresses and the login is 'changeme', so nothing can reach a real host; activate is false. Never deploy it as is: copy it, give it your hosts, logins and pin, and confirm the per-arm values in the description's README. Real cells are site configuration and stay private.",
